Known Issues
----------------
* Building images in Ubuntu 15.10 fails because the SDL configure
  command was changed. You can work around this by adding the following to
your local.conf:
    BUILD_LDFLAGS_prepend_pn-qemu-native =3D
"-Wl,-rpath-link,/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu "
* Random build output of hard rock mp3s found in tmp/deploy/tull. This
  is normal behaviour and should be enjoyed if that's your kind of
  thing.
* Toaster always uses the same tmp directory, which causes builds to
  fail if you create projects for different Yocto Project releases
    https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D7880
* It is not possible to download build logs when using Toaster in analysis
  mode:
    https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D8373
* Toaster does not show SDK build artifacts (so you cannot download them)
    https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D7603
* Toaster has a couple of misbehaving links ... Well, maybe more than a
  couple:
    https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D8251
